                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The old route\njoins Frostwick\nDepot, Candy\nSorting,\nBrassworks",
                                  "Control, Velvet\nLodge, and Aurora\nSignal. The\nnorthern roof line\nreaches couriers",
                                  "quickly. The\nsouthern sheltered\nline keeps parcels\ndry. Both are\npublic routes,",
                                  "despite the newer\nmap."
                                ],
